{"id":"3d14d294ed1b6514","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-jump-strict.md","title":"Jump Strictly Increases","display":"thm-jump-strict — Jump Strictly Increases","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-jump-strict","aliases":["88-thm-jump-strict"],"display":"thm-jump-strict — Jump Strictly Increases","depends_on":["[[88-df-jump-operator-def]]","[[88-df-turing-jump]]","[[88-df-turing-reduction]]","[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]","[[88-thm-jump-strict-def]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-jump-strict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-jump-strict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-jump-strict — Jump Strictly Increases"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c749f46fbad31f8b\" href=\"?note=c749f46fbad31f8b\" title=\"88-df-jump-operator-def\">88-df-jump-operator-def</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8c35cc87b3063540\" href=\"?note=8c35cc87b3063540\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-enumeration\">88-lem-oracle-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"07bb4f1dbc54e232\" href=\"?note=07bb4f1dbc54e232\" title=\"88-thm-jump-strict-def\">88-thm-jump-strict-def</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(A)=A&#39;\">\\(J(A)=A&#39;\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c749f46fbad31f8b\" href=\"?note=c749f46fbad31f8b\" title=\"88-df-jump-operator-def\">88-df-jump-operator-def</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e\">\\(F_e\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a>，合法规则图的实现见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8c35cc87b3063540\" href=\"?note=8c35cc87b3063540\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-enumeration\">88-lem-oracle-enumeration</a>。</li>\n<li>正向归约已由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"07bb4f1dbc54e232\" href=\"?note=07bb4f1dbc54e232\" title=\"88-thm-jump-strict-def\">88-thm-jump-strict-def</a> 证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jump\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(A\\leq_TJ(A)\\land\\neg(J(A)\\leq_TA)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jump\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(A\\leq_TJ(A)\\land\\neg(J(A)\\leq_TA)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(A)\">\\(J(A)\\)</span> 的总特征函数。从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e\">\\(F_e\\)</span> 中只保留输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的规则，得到合法 c.e. 规则图</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G=\\{\\langle\\sigma,x,0\\rangle:\\langle\\sigma,x,0\\rangle\\in F_e\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G=\\{\\langle\\sigma,x,0\\rangle:\\langle\\sigma,x,0\\rangle\\in F_e\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_d=G\">\\(F_d=G\\)</span>。由于原函数在神谕 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 下总且只输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span>，有</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d\\in J(A)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_d^A)\n\\leftrightarrow\\varphi_e^A(d)=0\\leftrightarrow d\\notin J(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d\\in J(A)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_d^A)\n\\leftrightarrow\\varphi_e^A(d)=0\\leftrightarrow d\\notin J(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>矛盾。与正向归约合并得到结论。这里使用神谕规则的有效性与单值性，并未把“严格增加”的结论重新命名为一个前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-jump-operator-def","status":"resolved","id":"c749f46fbad31f8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-jump-operator-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2b6a4a081d493b4c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"ceb241b03d936136","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-oracle-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"8c35cc87b3063540","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-jump-strict-def","status":"resolved","id":"07bb4f1dbc54e232","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-thm-jump-strict-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-jump-operator-def","status":"resolved","id":"c749f46fbad31f8b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$J(A)=A'$ 见 [[88-df-jump-operator-def]]、[[88-df-turing-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2b6a4a081d493b4c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$J(A)=A'$ 见 [[88-df-jump-operator-def]]、[[88-df-turing-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"ceb241b03d936136","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_T$ 见 [[88-df-turing-reduction]]；$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_T$ 见 [[88-df-turing-reduction]]；$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F_e$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]，合法规则图的实现见 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-oracle-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"8c35cc87b3063540","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F_e$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]，合法规则图的实现见 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-jump-strict-def","status":"resolved","id":"07bb4f1dbc54e232","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"正向归约已由 [[88-thm-jump-strict-def]] 证明。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"J(A)=A'","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"F_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jump\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(A\\leq_TJ(A)\\land\\neg(J(A)\\leq_TA)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"J(A)","display":false},{"tex":"F_e","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\{\\langle\\sigma,x,0\\rangle:\\langle\\sigma,x,0\\rangle\\in F_e\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"d","display":fa